Retain global native custody until the last profile returns to legacy; serialized drain/restart callbacks retain failed-stop custody. Add bootstrap-only selector collection with canonical route unwrapping and discard all undecorated bodies. This checkpoint is inert: no web lifespan activation or default-ON release yet.

Proof: canonical runner 10 files/131 passed/0 failed; whole-tree scripts/check --base origin/main green. Killing mutants: rollback before last profile, skipped bootstrap cache unwrap, cross-board attention duplicate; each fails intended assertion and restored suite is green. Bootstrap fixture is not production route/live acceptance.
